    "claims": [
      {
        "claim": "From behind the counter, you see two different crowds. The folks walking past on Telegraph are mostly new — younger, on their phones, heading to the tech offices or the pop-ups. The ones who actually come in are the regulars, the ones who've been here since before the rent signs went up. We get a few curious walk-ins, sure, but the people who buy records are the same faces I've seen for years. The block's moving faster than the store is, if that makes sense.",
